1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Since 1958, NASA has left machines
all over the solar system.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,000
Meet Echo, the last message
they ever sent home.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Echo takes kids from the Moon
to interstellar space in five minutes…

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,000
…then every machine
tells its own story…

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
…as a cartoon, a comic and a podcast,
all 49 of them.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Animations show how they really worked…

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
…and kids can walk the real landing sites.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Every game uses real physics, and every fact
is checked against NASA records.

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Ghosts of Exploration:
abandoned, but not forgotten.

